sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Medico as Medico Tratante
    participant Frontend as Cliente React (HceScreen)
    participant API as Fiber Router / Middleware
    participant Service as ClinicalRecordService
    participant Crypto as Pkg Crypto (SHA-256)
    participant DB as MySQL Database / Triggers

    Note over Medico, DB: Flujo 1: Firma Digital y Cierre de Folio Inmutable
    Medico->>+Frontend: Clic en "Firmar y Cerrar Folio Clinico"
    Frontend->>+API: POST /api/v1/clinical-records/:id/close
    API->>API: Valida Rol MEDICO y Sesion JWT
    API->>+Service: CloseAndSign(recordID, doctorID, token)
    Service->>+DB: SELECT * FROM clinical_records WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>-Service: Folio en estado borrador (is_closed = false)
    Service->>+DB: SELECT hash_sha256 FROM clinical_records WHERE patient_id = ? ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 1
    DB-->>-Service: previous_hash (Hash del folio previo)
    Service->>+Crypto: ComputeRecordHash(folioData, previous_hash)
    Crypto-->>-Service: hash_sha256 (64 hex chars)
    Service->>+DB: UPDATE clinical_records SET is_closed=TRUE, previous_hash=?, hash_sha256=?
    DB-->>-Service: Folio cerrado y sellado criptograficamente
    Service-->>-API: Folio cerrado exitosamente
    API-->>-Frontend: HTTP 200 OK { is_closed: true, hash_sha256: "7a9f...c412" }
    Frontend-->>-Medico: Candado verde activado: "Folio Inmutable Cerrado"

    Note over Medico, DB: Flujo 2: Intento Ilegal de Modificacion sobre Folio Cerrado
    Medico->>+Frontend: Intenta editar anamnesis o conducta
    Frontend->>Frontend: Bloqueo de inputs en interfaz (Solo Lectura)
    Frontend->>+API: PUT /api/v1/clinical-records/:id (Intento directo)
    API->>+Service: UpdateRecord(...)
    Service->>Service: Verifica is_closed == true
    Service-->>API: Error domain.ErrRecordIsImmutable
    API-->>-Frontend: HTTP 403 Forbidden: "La Historia Clinica es inmutable (Res. 1995)"
    Frontend-->>-Medico: Mensaje de restriccion legal

    Note over Medico, DB: Flujo 3: Anexo Legal de Nota Aclaratoria (Res. 1995/1999)
    Medico->>+Frontend: Redacta Nota Aclaratoria con justificacion
    Frontend->>+API: POST /api/v1/clinical-records/:id/clarifications
    API->>+Service: AddClarification(recordID, doctorID, note)
    Service->>+DB: INSERT INTO clinical_record_clarifications (clinical_record_id, doctor_id, note)
    DB-->>-Service: Nota aclaratoria guardada sin alterar el folio original
    Service-->>-API: Nota registrada
    API-->>-Frontend: HTTP 201 Created { clarification_id }
    Frontend-->>-Medico: Confirmacion: Nota incorporada en el historial
